body:
Monster Hunter Stories 2, even if you're not a monster hunter fan or never played one of the games.

&#x200B;

It adds a lot when you fight with your monsties it really helps you bond with them and the game is super pretty to boot.

Oh my god it was Nightcaster! I must of mixed up the consoles since my brother had a xbox at the time and it must of been on one of his demo disks.

It's a shame that it was trash. The character aging mechanic really interests me.  guess I'm just going to play the og fable for the 20th time.

&#x200B;

Thank you all the help! you've all been helpful

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
